2328
02:10:05,520 --> 02:10:07,940
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: And the challenge po to that is when you look at their finances,

2329
02:10:09,080 --> 02:10:11,160
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: itatayo nila sa start.

2330
02:10:11,680 --> 02:10:13,280
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Pero lahat ng susunod na gastos,

2331
