EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: But actually, do they fund eventually?

2342
02:10:50,040 --> 02:10:51,320
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Hindi po talagang nangyayari.

2343
02:10:51,420 --> 02:10:54,640
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Which is why the LUC governance bill that is in the committee now

2344
02:10:54,640 --> 02:10:55,580
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: will really play a

2345
02:10:55,580 --> 02:10:56,580
