2352
02:11:17,060 --> 02:11:20,160
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Kasi talagang hindi po natin kakayanin yung lobo na

2353
02:11:20,160 --> 02:11:22,600
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: lahat, inasa lahat sa national government.

2354
02:11:23,000 --> 02:11:26,120
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: Tapos biglang, by the second year, wala nang pinupondo si LGU.

2355
02:11:26,120 --> 02:11:30,700
EDCOM 2 Executive Director Karol Mark Yee: So that's really a challenge, sir, in quality and also in the sustainability.

