Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi puro voice calls.

2713
02:33:00,100 --> 02:33:06,920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And I am predicting that AI will have a massive effect on them.

2714
02:33:07,060 --> 02:33:10,380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Dahil next time, kausap na ng tao, artificial intelligence.

2715
02:33:10,380 --> 02:33:13,320
