TESDA Deputy Director General Galo B. Glino III: Yes, sir.

2725
02:33:52,460 --> 02:33:52,860
TESDA Deputy Director General Galo B. Glino III: In other words?

2726
02:33:52,900 --> 02:33:53,180
TESDA Deputy Director General Galo B. Glino III: Yes, sir.

2727
02:33:53,180 --> 02:33:53,280
TESDA Deputy Director General Galo B. Glino III: Okay.

